<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτάνη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pasture</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.493
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ βοτάνης ἀνιόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					28.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγρονται ἐς βοτάναν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					773.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἁ λέοντος</span> the lion's
				<i>pasture</i>, i.e. Nemea, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				6.42
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐν κακῇ β. τρεφόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					401c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fodder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.411
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>herb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.4.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Praef.</u>
				1
			</span></i> (pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in
			pl., <i>plants</i>, as material for making clothes, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοραί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.
			</span></i> Oen. <i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>weeds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.7.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				729.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.46.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὰ β.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερεών</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.60
			</span></i>.</div>
